WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
P2LRN Studio opens a water cycle lesson and prepares its visual editing area.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
A water cycle diagram is placed, showing the sun, clouds, mountains and water.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Labels are added and adjusted for evaporation, condensation and precipitation.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The Spanish title "El Ciclo del Agua" is added, with explanatory text around the diagram.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.208
The final lesson layout is reviewed, including its text and visual elements.
